genetics-title = Genetics laboratory
genetics-instructions = Analyze a living patient, then select a block and one of its three digits to modify. The outcome is unpredictable. The procedure requires unstable mutagen; repeated exposure causes poisoning.
genetics-status = { $patient } | Mutagen: { $mutagen } u | { $status }
genetics-admin-status = { $patient } | Stability: { $stability } | Mutagen: { $mutagen } u | { $status }
genetics-admin-instructions = ADMIN: mutation names, exact block editing and genome restoration are available. Using the digit buttons may poison the patient.
