genetics-write-disk = Write genome to disk
genetics-lab-disk-help = Insert a disk and record the current genome after scanning. Recording replaces the previous sample. Transfer the disk to a genetic printer to print the stored sample without a patient.
genetics-disk-written = Genome recorded on disk.
genetics-disk-title = Genetic disk
genetics-disk-help = The disk stores one sample containing all of its block values. Record samples in a laboratory; print injectors and erase recordings in a genetic printer.
genetics-disk-missing = Insert a genetic disk.
genetics-disk-empty = No sample recorded on disk.
genetics-disk-recorded = Sample recorded. Blocks: { $count }.
genetics-disk-incompatible = Recording incompatible with the current calibration. Viewing and full disk erasure are available.
genetics-disk-examine-recorded = The disk holds a sample of { $count } blocks. Activate it to view the recording.
genetics-disk-examine-empty = No sample recorded on disk.
genetics-printer-title = Genetic printer
genetics-printer-help = Insert a recorded disk and select a block to produce an injector. You can also print an injector of the entire sample: it replaces all of the recipient's blocks when injected. Printing requires unstable mutagen. Resetting blocks and erasing the sample only affect the disk recording.
genetics-printer-status = Mutagen: { $mutagen } u | { $status }
genetics-printer-print-block = Print block { $number } injector
genetics-printer-print-genome = Print full genome injector
genetics-printer-reset-block = Reset disk block { $number }
genetics-printer-confirm-reset = Confirm block reset
genetics-printer-clear = Erase entire sample from disk
genetics-printer-confirm-clear = Confirm disk erasure
genetics-admin-verb = Manage genes
genetics-admin-verb-description = Open administrative genome block controls.
genetics-admin-title = ADMIN: gene management
genetics-admin-help = Shows this round's mutation assignments. Enabling sets FFF; disabling sets 000, without toxic damage. Stability and active mutation effects still apply normally. Empty blocks contain no mutation.
genetics-admin-target = { $target } | Stability: { $stability }
genetics-admin-unavailable = Genome unavailable
genetics-admin-refresh = Refresh
genetics-admin-enable = Enable
genetics-admin-disable = Disable
