genetics-empty-block = Empty block
genetics-active = active
genetics-inactive = inactive
genetics-unknown = Unknown mutation
genetics-rescan = The genome has changed. Analyze it again.
genetics-invalid-sample = The sample is missing or unsuitable for this procedure.
genetics-no-mutagen = Not enough unstable mutagen.
genetics-injected = Genetic sample injected.
genetics-telekinesis-unreachable = You cannot reach that object with your mind.
genetics-telekinesis-held-failed = You cannot affect that object with what you are holding. Try freeing your active hand.
genetics-telekinesis-failed = The object does not yield to your mental touch.
genetics-cloak-cooldown = You cannot yet make your body blend into its surroundings again.
genetics-injector-block-name = genetic injector (block { $number })
genetics-injector-genome-name = genetic injector (full genome)
genetics-feeling-loss = Some of the unfamiliar sensations leave your body.
genetics-feeling-telekinesis = You feel as though you could reach objects with thought alone.
genetics-feeling-hulk = Strength surges through your muscles. The barriers around you seem surprisingly fragile.
genetics-feeling-view = Unfamiliar images flicker at the edge of your mind, as though another pair of eyes has opened somewhere.
genetics-feeling-cloak = A ripple passes over your skin. You feel you could blend into your surroundings.
genetics-feeling-devour = A strange hunger grips you. Even metal seems quite edible.
genetics-feeling-mimic = Your features seem less fixed. Taking on another face feels within reach.
genetics-feeling-breathing = You realize you no longer feel the need to take your next breath.
genetics-feeling-cold = A steady warmth fills your body. The cold no longer feels threatening.
genetics-feeling-heat = Heat seems to retreat from your skin, as though your body has learned to turn it away.
genetics-feeling-regeneration = A gentle tingling spreads beneath your skin, as though your tissues are drawing themselves together.
genetics-feeling-psyresist = Your mind grows quiet. Your thoughts feel sheltered behind a thick veil.
genetics-feeling-lethargy = Your limbs grow heavy. Every movement takes a little more effort.
genetics-feeling-brittle = An unpleasant sensitivity spreads through your body. Even a light touch feels sharp.
genetics-genostabilin-effect = Suppresses acquired genetic mutations as the body metabolizes it.
reagent-name-genostabilin = genostabilin
reagent-desc-genostabilin = A treatment that suppresses acquired genetic mutations as it is metabolized by the body.
genetics-view-title = Remote viewing
genetics-view-refresh = Refresh carriers
genetics-view-stop = Stop observing
genetics-view-empty = No available carriers.
genetics-gene-telekinesis = Telekinesis
genetics-gene-telekinesis-desc = Pick up items, activate objects and use held tools at a distance.
genetics-gene-hulk = Hulk
genetics-gene-hulk-desc = Grants inhuman strength and resilience, making strenuous exertion easier and allowing doors to be forced open with bare hands.
genetics-gene-view = Remote viewing
genetics-gene-view-desc = Observe the surroundings of another living carrier of this mutation without psychic protection.
genetics-gene-cloak = Chameleon
genetics-gene-cloak-desc = Activate camouflage. Hits and offensive actions disrupt it.
genetics-gene-devour = Matter eater
genetics-gene-devour-desc = Eat items, structures, creatures and floor layers. Contained items are left outside.
genetics-gene-mimic = Mimicry
genetics-gene-mimic-desc = Copy another humanoid's appearance, name and voice, then restore your own.
genetics-gene-breathing = Autonomous respiration
genetics-gene-breathing-desc = Removes the body's need to breathe.
genetics-gene-cold = Cold adaptation
genetics-gene-cold-desc = Protects the body against hypothermia and low pressure.
genetics-gene-heat = Heat adaptation
genetics-gene-heat-desc = Protects the body against overheating and high pressure.
genetics-gene-regeneration = Regeneration
genetics-gene-regeneration-desc = Gradually heals physical injuries and burns in a living body, including critical condition.
genetics-gene-psyresist = Psychic resistance
genetics-gene-psyresist-desc = Prevents genetic remote viewing through the carrier.
genetics-gene-lethargy = Lethargy
genetics-gene-lethargy-desc = Makes movement slow and labored.
genetics-gene-brittle = Brittleness
genetics-gene-brittle-desc = Makes bodily tissues more vulnerable to injury.
ent-GeneticsLaboratory = genetics laboratory
    .desc = A scanner for genome research, producing injectors from the patient's sample, and recording samples on disks. Editing blocks and printing requires unstable mutagen.
ent-GeneticsLaboratoryCircuitboard = genetics laboratory machine board
    .desc = A board for constructing a genetic scanner with a built-in console.
ent-GeneticDisk = genetic disk
    .desc = A portable carrier for one genetic sample. Activate to view its blocks, or insert it into a genetic printer to produce injectors.
ent-GeneticInjectorPrinter = genetic printer
    .desc = Produces single-block or full-genome injectors from a genetic disk. Can reset recorded blocks or erase samples. Printing requires unstable mutagen.
ent-GeneticInjectorPrinterCircuitboard = genetic printer machine board
    .desc = A circuit board for constructing a genetic injector printer.
ent-CrateGeneticInjectorPrinter = genetic printer kit
    .desc = Contains a genetic printer board, two disks, and four bottles of unstable mutagen.
ent-GeneticInjector = genetic injector
    .desc = A disposable injector carrying a genetic sample. Administration causes poisoning.
ent-BaseGeneticInjectorAdmin = genetic injector
    .desc = An injector containing a stabilized genetic sample.
ent-GeneticsRound = genetic map
ent-GeneticsLaboratoryDebug = debug genetics laboratory
    .desc = A laboratory with exact block editing and full mutation information for administrative testing.
