ent-GeneticInjectorColdResistance = cold adaptation genetic injector
ent-GeneticInjectorHeatResistance = heat adaptation genetic injector
ent-GeneticInjectorRegeneration = regeneration genetic injector
ent-GeneticInjectorPsyResist = psychic resistance genetic injector
ent-GeneticInjectorLethargy = lethargy genetic injector
ent-GeneticInjectorBrittle = brittleness genetic injector
