ent-ActionGeneticTelekinesis = Telekinesis
    .desc = Interact with an accessible object within ten meters. An empty hand picks up or activates; a held tool is used on the target.
ent-ActionGeneticPry = Force pry
    .desc = Force a nearby door open.
ent-ActionGeneticRemoteViewing = Remote viewing
    .desc = Select another carrier of this mutation to observe.
ent-ActionGeneticCloak = Genetic camouflage
    .desc = Make your body blend into its surroundings. Blows and sudden combat movements disrupt the camouflage; recovering it takes time.
ent-ActionGeneticDevour = Devour
    .desc = Devour a nearby item, structure or creature. You must remain still; pain may keep you from finishing your meal.
ent-ActionGeneticEatTile = Eat floor
    .desc = Eat the upper layer of the floor beside you.
ent-ActionGeneticMimic = Copy appearance
    .desc = Take on a nearby humanoid's appearance, name and voice. Your identification cards and permissions remain yours.
ent-ActionGeneticRestoreAppearance = Restore appearance
    .desc = Restore your own appearance, name and voice.
